(7755644, 1282711, 50864, '<td valign="top">The term positive space in photography is only ever used to refer to the positive/negative space relationship and with that in mind this is genius. You have managed to use a colorful busy background to add interest to the subject. Everything about the subject is amazing. The pose, the facial expression and the wonderful shirt that ties the whole thing together. Brilliant in so many ways. Easy 10.<br/> <br/>Team Spleen would like to award you with our highest award, The Spleen Queen.<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1282683" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'The term positive space in photography is only ever used to refer to the positive/negative space relationship and with that in mind this is genius. You have managed to use a colorful busy background to add interest to the subject. Everything about the subject is amazing. The pose, the facial expression and the wonderful shirt that ties the whole thing together. Brilliant in so many ways. Easy 10. Team Spleen would like to award you with our highest award, The Spleen Queen.', '2023-08-03 21:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755645, 1282750, 50864, '<td valign="top">Team Spleen would be honored by your presence in the Queen''s Court.<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1156027" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50641/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1156027.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'Team Spleen would be honored by your presence in the Queen''s Court.', '2023-08-03 21:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
