(7755671, 1282711, 30049, '<td valign="top">Photographers Comments: <i>"Me: Wait. Can you please stand there just for a second? Ha!"</i> <br/> <br/>Did you REALLY say that?!  :-D  ... like this was some random person and you got them to stop and pose?  If so, that''s WAY cool!</td>', 'Photographers Comments: "Me: Wait. Can you please stand there just for a second? Ha!"  Did you REALLY say that?!  :-D  ... like this was some random person and you got them to stop and pose?  If so, that''s WAY cool!', '2023-08-04 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7755673, 1282711, 100831, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Photographers Comments: <i>"Me: Wait. Can you please stand there just for a second? Ha!"</i> <br/> <br/>Did you REALLY say that?!  :-D  ... like this was some random person and you got them to stop and pose?  If so, that''s WAY cool! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The shot was definitely unplanned but the person is a family member.<br/> <br/>Edit to add... and yes, I really said that.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2023-08-04 11:43:18.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Photographers Comments: "Me: Wait. Can you please stand there just for a second? Ha!"  Did you REALLY say that?!  :-D  ... like this was some random person and you got them to stop and pose?  If so, that''s WAY cool!   The shot was definitely unplanned but the person is a family member. Edit to add... and yes, I really said that.', '2023-08-04 10:54:02.000000', '2023-08-04 12:43:18.000000', 0),
